 ### Inter-frame Delta Encoding with Haar Wavelets
-* **Definition:** Classifies each time step as an intra-coded or predictive frame [S3]. All frames are encoded with Haar wavelets, but predictive frames are also expressed as deltas with respect to previous frames and then encoded [S3].
